  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: IR-8

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SOC-INC-002
TITLE: Contain
STATEMENT: Security shall record the containment action and the time it was taken.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-SOC-004
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-AUD-002
