[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SOC-INC-003
TITLE: Disable the account
STATEMENT: Security shall be able to request that Identity disable an involved account during the case.
STATUS: Approved
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-SOC-004
