  VALUE: V-222596

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SOC-INC-004
TITLE: Customer notice
STATEMENT: Security shall track a required customer or patient notice to a delivery result.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-SOC-006
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-OPS-008
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: IR-6

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SOC-INC-005
TITLE: Lessons
STATEMENT: Security shall record a lesson and whether a requirement changed because of it.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-SOC-004
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: IR-4.1

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SOC-INC-006
TITLE: Roster
STATEMENT: Security shall use the current on-call roster from Messaging for the first notification.
