  VALUE: IR-6

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SOC-INC-007
TITLE: Hold the log
STATEMENT: Security shall place a hold on the audit records of an open incident so they are not disposed.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-REC-003
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-AUD-004
