UID: SOC-EVD-003
TITLE: Sample
STATEMENT: Security shall record the population and the sample size an assessor used.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-SOC-005
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: CA-2

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SOC-EVD-004
TITLE: Keep evidence
STATEMENT: Security shall retain evidence for the life of the authorization and the following review.
STATUS: Active
RELATIONS:
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: ENT-SOC-005
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: Refines
  VALUE: PLT-AUD-005
- TYPE: Parent
  ROLE: ConformsTo
  VALUE: AU-11

[REQUIREMENT]
UID: SOC-EVD-005
